# Humility: "All creatures lose all abilities and have base power and toughness 1/1." Bot1's first Inspiring Overseer
# (a 2/1 with flying) enters before Humility, and its "When this creature enters, you gain 1 life and draw a card"
# triggers and resolves (the positive control: Bot1 goes to 21 and draws). Then Humility makes it a 1/1 with no flying.
# The second Overseer enters under Humility: a creature on the battlefield has no abilities, and an enters trigger is
# looked for on the permanent as it is on the battlefield (CR 603.2, 603.6a, 613.1f), so it never triggers - Bot1 stays at
# 21 with an empty hand. Both are 1/1 (CR 613.4b) and neither has flying.

